haus Manifesto: Broad alliance promoting artistic freedom</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dcf63999e9251109eee8f22b2ec5abab8708c60530014dedd1caf446812da8b8</id><updated>2026-09-09T04:54:21Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T10:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bauhaus-manifesto-broad-alliance-promoting-artistic-freedom/a-78456460--2d3d86ae9554.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bauhaus-manifesto-broad-alliance-promoting-artistic-freedom/a-78456460?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Weeks before Saxony-Anhalt's state election, representatives from German cultural, crafts, architecture, design and church sectors unite to promote freedom, openness and creativity.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Hunger stones: The history behind 'if you see me, weep'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:543fe6fc2c925dfb7e7e29af5bca06f651aa70dcb52435f062ab87892e250a8a</id><updated>2026-09-09T04:54:21Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729--34d8ccc8292a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hunger-stones-the-history-behind-if-you-see-me-weep/a-78345729?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Centuries-old hunger stones are emerging as Europe's rivers recede. Among the most famous is the Decin hunger stone in the Elbe River with its cryptic message.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Why North Korea's women's football team is so good</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6bcd481db424f85ff86775f85fbadac15a0c2641def28da1fd512bb9ee52538f</id><updated>2026-09-09T04:54:21Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-women-s-football-team-is-so-good/a-70313505--6b31ccb5ebf0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href